### Create an order
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subtotalCents": 12000,
  "customerTier": "PREMIUM",
  "firstPurchase": true,
  "couponCode": "SAVE10",
  "deliveryMethod": "STANDARD"
}

### Replace 1 with the id returned above
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1
